"text":"কিন্তু মই হ’লে অভাবগ্রস্ত আৰু দৰিদ্ৰ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"হে ঈশ্বৰ, মোৰ ওচৰলৈ শীঘ্ৰে আহাঁ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"তুমি মোৰ সহায় আৰু মোৰ উদ্ধাৰকৰ্ত্তা;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"হে যিহোৱা, পলম নকৰিবা।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/70.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/71.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/asm_irv/PSA/69.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}